WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.625
Hello and welcome to my platform, You Are That.

2
00:00:03.625 --> 00:00:06.359
It is designed to help you on your path,

3
00:00:06.359 --> 00:00:10.167
providing accessible tools in milestones

4
00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:14.064
to direct you as you grow,
towards an awakened consciousness.

5
00:00:14.064 --> 00:00:20.218
I encourage you to take your time,
be patient, be compassionate and humble,
and allow yourself

6
00:00:20.218 --> 00:00:24.882
to expand as you listen and read and learn.

7
00:00:24.882 --> 00:00:30.942
And if there's any issue whatsoever,
don't hesitate to contact me directly
so I can help you if required.

8
00:00:30.942 --> 00:00:35.661
I wish you a pleasant journey. Thank you.
